desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "python"
	title: "结构扫描：Python Cookie secure=False"
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Python Cookie secure=False"
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "struct-python-set-cookie-secure-false"
	risk: "cookie-security"
	cwe: "CWE-614"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
set_cookie(..., secure=False) 允许浏览器在明文 HTTP 上发送该 Cookie。

### 风险类型
cookie-security

### 影响
命中说明编译单元里出现了该调用，而不是注释或字符串。

### 检测方式
结构扫描匹配真实调用。
### 参考
- CWE-614
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
会话 Cookie 设置 secure=True，并且只通过 HTTPS 提供服务。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://bad.py": <<<POS
def bad(resp):
    resp.set_cookie("sid", "v", secure=False)

POS
	"safefile://ok.py": <<<NEG
def ok():
    return 1

NEG
)
set_cookie as $call
set_cookie(* as $arg) as $call
alert $call for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "结构扫描：Python Cookie secure=False",
	title_zh: "结构扫描：Python Cookie secure=False",
	message: "结构扫描：Python Cookie secure=False",
	risk: "cookie-security",
}
